WEBVTT

00:07.007 --> 00:09.009
[poignant ambient music]

00:12.345 --> 00:14.347
[wind whistling]

01:11.488 --> 01:13.114
[breathing raggedly]

01:22.248 --> 01:24.417
[man choking]

01:29.422 --> 01:30.715
[gasping]

01:31.466 --> 01:33.802
[shakily] Please… help. I…

01:34.719 --> 01:36.721
[wheezing]

01:45.897 --> 01:48.566
You fucked up… your own suicide?

01:50.068 --> 01:51.236
Just kill me.

01:52.695 --> 01:53.780
Please.

01:54.280 --> 01:55.323
[scoffs]

02:00.161 --> 02:02.038
[man groaning]

02:02.122 --> 02:03.581
[Niragi sighs]

02:06.459 --> 02:07.794
[whimpers]

02:16.511 --> 02:18.304
[wheezing]

02:27.564 --> 02:29.190
[laughs]

02:30.775 --> 02:33.611
Oh, did you think I was gonna
put you out of your misery?

02:34.195 --> 02:35.238
[gasps]

02:36.281 --> 02:38.158
- [gasping]
- [chuckles]

02:38.241 --> 02:40.785
- Are you fuckin' stupid?
- [screams]

02:41.703 --> 02:44.998
- I'm gonna make you fucking suffer.
- [whimpering]

02:45.081 --> 02:47.500
- [wails]
- Little bitch.

02:49.002 --> 02:50.253
[Niragi laughing]

02:52.005 --> 02:53.882
[man gasping]

02:54.757 --> 02:56.551
- [moans]
- [Niragi laughs]

03:02.932 --> 03:05.602
I'm gonna make everyone wish
they'd never met me.

03:09.397 --> 03:12.400
Then I'm gonna die
and go straight to hell.

03:31.127 --> 03:33.129
[theme music]

04:33.648 --> 04:35.817
[computer] Difficulty, Queen of Clubs.

04:38.403 --> 04:39.862
Game, Target.

04:40.863 --> 04:43.574
Please wait until the game commences.

04:45.326 --> 04:46.744
[silence]

04:53.793 --> 04:54.877
[gasps softly]

05:07.348 --> 05:08.891
Did you think I was dead?

05:08.975 --> 05:10.184
[laughs] No.

05:11.060 --> 05:13.271
I knew that I would see you again.

05:13.354 --> 05:14.605
You're too strong to die.

05:15.773 --> 05:16.858
Strong, huh?

05:19.110 --> 05:20.611
[sighs] You know, Kuina,

05:21.321 --> 05:23.948
I started wondering
if waiting for death might be easier.

05:24.032 --> 05:26.784
[sighs] Yeah, I had similar thoughts.

05:29.370 --> 05:31.080
But at least we're both here now.

05:33.499 --> 05:34.876
[Ann] Clubs are team games.

05:35.543 --> 05:37.920
It should be much easier
with two of us playing.

05:38.588 --> 05:41.090
Just a few more games.
We'll make it to the end.

05:41.174 --> 05:43.926
Huh. Mmm. I'm sure we will.

05:50.099 --> 05:52.393
[computer] Registration has closed.

05:52.477 --> 05:54.604
The game will now commence.

05:56.564 --> 05:58.566
- [yells]
- [grunts]

06:23.424 --> 06:24.467
[yelps]

06:49.158 --> 06:50.785
[gasping]

06:52.995 --> 06:54.664
[coughing and whimpering]

07:06.551 --> 07:08.010
[screams]

07:09.011 --> 07:11.431
- [man] Don't go in!
- [all yelling and gasping]

07:21.232 --> 07:22.567
[yells]

07:25.945 --> 07:28.239
- [all gasp]
- [growling]

07:29.073 --> 07:30.658
[all whimpering]

07:31.659 --> 07:33.744
[roaring]

07:36.414 --> 07:38.291
[growling]

07:38.374 --> 07:39.417
[all screaming]

07:39.500 --> 07:40.585
[dynamic music]

07:42.044 --> 07:44.005
[yelling and panting]

07:52.054 --> 07:53.055
[screams]

07:53.139 --> 07:54.307
[wails]

08:16.787 --> 08:18.789
[music fades]

08:18.873 --> 08:20.875
[engines rumbling]

08:25.296 --> 08:27.298
[wind whistling]

08:43.481 --> 08:45.358
[footsteps]

09:38.953 --> 09:40.955
[wind gusting]

10:05.229 --> 10:06.606
[quiet ambient music]

10:40.181 --> 10:41.349
[Chishiya] Hey!

10:44.935 --> 10:46.604
Fancy meeting you here.

10:47.938 --> 10:51.025
- Chishiya.
- There are only two games left.

10:51.859 --> 10:53.986
Players are starting to gather in Shibuya.

10:55.571 --> 10:59.200
I had a pretty good hunch
that you were probably still alive.

11:08.709 --> 11:09.543
What?

11:10.252 --> 11:11.962
Is that the only thing you've gotta say?

11:13.130 --> 11:14.006
So?

11:14.090 --> 11:15.591
[Arisu] Nothing. It's just…

11:16.634 --> 11:18.135
You're a lot less grumpy now.

11:18.844 --> 11:20.137
[Chishiya laughs]

11:20.846 --> 11:22.640
Oh, less grumpy, huh?

11:23.683 --> 11:26.352
Well, I've been through a hell of a lot.

11:30.648 --> 11:31.941
Hey, Arisu…

11:33.943 --> 11:35.903
can I share something with you

11:36.696 --> 11:38.531
that I've never told anyone before?

11:40.866 --> 11:41.909
[chuckles]

11:43.327 --> 11:44.495
Yeah.

11:48.541 --> 11:49.417
Well, I--

11:49.500 --> 11:50.793
[gunshot]

11:51.293 --> 11:52.128
[Niragi] Yo!

11:56.507 --> 11:58.384
I thought I'd never see you again!

11:58.467 --> 12:00.344
I am so fuckin' happy!

12:00.928 --> 12:02.096
Niragi!

12:02.805 --> 12:05.266
Did you mean to miss a vital organ?

12:05.349 --> 12:08.310
[Niragi] I didn't want to end things
with a surprise attack.

12:09.687 --> 12:11.021
So let's begin.

12:11.856 --> 12:13.274
It's a new murder game.

12:14.525 --> 12:18.112
Not like there's anything else
for the three of us to do here.

12:18.863 --> 12:21.449
[Chishiya] You want to start a game
between players?

12:22.450 --> 12:24.368
[Niragi] The three of us are the same.

12:25.077 --> 12:28.080
Social outcasts. Losers.

12:28.873 --> 12:32.084
Yet we still want to know how it feels
to be alive, more than anyone.

12:35.254 --> 12:36.630
[coughing]

12:40.301 --> 12:41.343
[breathing heavily]

12:41.427 --> 12:43.220
I don't have very much time left.

12:43.804 --> 12:46.182
[sighs] Do me one last favor.

12:47.016 --> 12:48.893
One more game, come on!

12:48.976 --> 12:51.645
I thought you guys were my bros!

13:07.495 --> 13:08.871
Sounds like fun.

13:10.414 --> 13:12.166
Arisu, what do you think?

13:12.249 --> 13:13.751
[Arisu] What do you mean?

13:13.834 --> 13:17.421
[Chishiya] Come on, don't play dumb.
I know you've got a bone to pick with me.

13:17.505 --> 13:19.507
We might as well deal with it right now.

13:20.424 --> 13:22.426
We can settle things once and for all.

13:23.010 --> 13:25.179
[Arisu] What the hell
are you talking about?

13:25.262 --> 13:28.015
[Niragi] Come on, where's your gun?
I know you got one!

13:29.725 --> 13:32.102
[Arisu] There's gotta be
another way to do this.

13:39.610 --> 13:40.778
[groans]

13:40.861 --> 13:42.613
[gunshots echoing]

13:43.531 --> 13:45.866
Niragi! Stop this!

13:45.950 --> 13:47.785
I'm just acting like you guys.

13:47.868 --> 13:49.620
Doing whatever I feel like.

13:49.703 --> 13:52.832
Every time you open your mouths,
it's just to talk about yourselves.

13:52.915 --> 13:55.000
I've had to listen to your bullshit
the whole time.

13:55.918 --> 13:59.713
Stop acting like you're better than
everyone because you've seen people die.

14:00.381 --> 14:02.758
And don't say you're trying to survive
for someone else,

14:02.842 --> 14:05.594
because I know that deep down,
you're just as selfish!

14:05.678 --> 14:08.389
The only thing that matters
is that we come out on top!

14:10.516 --> 14:13.519
You said it'd all work out
if we worked together!

14:13.602 --> 14:16.605
From the very start,
you just wanted to be the only survivor!

14:16.689 --> 14:19.358
I don't want it to end this way!

14:19.441 --> 14:21.402
Please, or you'll kill everyone.

14:21.485 --> 14:22.653
Do it for them!

14:22.736 --> 14:24.738
[wind whistling]

14:27.908 --> 14:28.826
Yeah.

14:30.202 --> 14:31.871
You might have a good point.

14:34.665 --> 14:38.043
Maybe we're all just supposed
to kill each other in this place.

14:38.127 --> 14:40.170
Now you're starting to make sense.

14:44.216 --> 14:45.342
Niragi…

14:47.595 --> 14:50.306
I know what you're trying to do,
but it won't work!

14:52.308 --> 14:53.893
You're trying to wear me down!

15:00.900 --> 15:01.901
Except…

15:03.861 --> 15:05.154
now it won't work.

15:06.864 --> 15:09.867
I'm not gonna act weak and selfish
ever again.

15:21.086 --> 15:22.171
I'm out.

15:33.182 --> 15:36.143
I'm not gonna pull this trigger
just so that I can survive.

15:55.537 --> 15:57.122
[Kuzuryu] I'm finally free.

15:58.123 --> 16:00.084
I made my own choice.

16:02.086 --> 16:04.004
And based on my own ideals.

16:05.881 --> 16:07.383
It's all because of you.

16:15.849 --> 16:17.476
[scoffs] You ruined it.

16:18.811 --> 16:20.270
Thanks a lot, asshole.

16:24.692 --> 16:25.693
[Usagi] Arisu?

16:34.284 --> 16:35.828
What's going on here?

16:41.750 --> 16:44.795
Oh, yeah. I almost forgot about you.

16:45.546 --> 16:47.047
[gasps]

16:47.131 --> 16:48.424
Usagi!

16:48.507 --> 16:51.176
Stop shooting!
She's got nothing to do with this!

16:51.760 --> 16:54.805
Games need a heroine to rescue.
But this one should die.

16:55.389 --> 16:56.849
[Arisu] What are you saying?

16:58.475 --> 16:59.935
If I kill you now,

17:01.061 --> 17:03.564
everything can go back to the way it was.

17:06.483 --> 17:09.194
You… just get in the way.

17:12.156 --> 17:14.283
[shots echoing]

17:14.366 --> 17:15.534
[gasps]

17:16.285 --> 17:17.327
[whimpers]

17:25.252 --> 17:26.754
[gasps]

17:33.302 --> 17:34.845
[gasps] Chishiya!

17:35.971 --> 17:37.264
Chishiya!

17:37.347 --> 17:40.350
[gasps] Chishiya! You saved me!

17:40.434 --> 17:42.436
- [Chishiya groans]
- Why did you do it?

17:43.562 --> 17:46.440
I wanted to do something
that was a bit out of character.

17:46.523 --> 17:47.691
[chuckles]

17:47.775 --> 17:51.153
[sighs] I know it's thanks
to the people I met here.

17:52.488 --> 17:53.864
Like Kuzuryu.

17:55.157 --> 17:56.617
Arisu, too.

17:58.494 --> 18:00.746
- [groans]
- Hey.

18:01.497 --> 18:03.707
Before, what were you gonna say?

18:04.500 --> 18:05.834
[grunts]

18:05.918 --> 18:07.753
Oh, yeah. [sighs]

18:07.836 --> 18:09.171
[laughs]

18:14.593 --> 18:15.886
Honest people…

18:18.889 --> 18:21.266
always seemed pretty stupid to me.

18:24.436 --> 18:26.688
I've always loved messing with people

18:27.689 --> 18:29.399
who try too hard at life.

18:31.443 --> 18:33.862
I hated selflessness.

18:34.988 --> 18:36.532
[breathing shakily]

18:37.533 --> 18:39.827
It's probably because I was jealous.

18:41.537 --> 18:43.664
They all had something I was missing.

18:46.291 --> 18:47.459
It was like

18:48.127 --> 18:49.670
they could always see

18:50.504 --> 18:53.632
what a pathetic and small-minded person
I really was.

18:56.009 --> 18:58.554
[gasps] I was always afraid.

19:03.225 --> 19:04.476
I get you.

19:08.063 --> 19:10.649
Yeah, I thought
you'd be the one to understand.

19:18.574 --> 19:20.409
[Niragi] I guess hunting rifles

19:20.993 --> 19:22.661
aren't as deadly as you thought.

19:23.537 --> 19:25.539
[panting]

19:26.665 --> 19:28.250
[laughing raggedly]

19:30.878 --> 19:32.254
Whatever you do,

19:34.381 --> 19:36.466
just don't make me out to be the villain.

19:40.721 --> 19:42.556
If there were seven billion of me,

19:45.142 --> 19:46.268
you guys

19:46.768 --> 19:48.478
would all be villains too.

19:54.067 --> 19:55.819
You're pretty lucky, you know.

19:58.280 --> 20:00.115
You guys are the majority.

20:07.080 --> 20:09.082
[rumbling]

20:09.166 --> 20:11.126
[wind whistling]

20:13.712 --> 20:15.714
[rumbling growing louder]

20:45.369 --> 20:46.495
Run.

20:50.457 --> 20:52.751
- [man shouts]
- [gunfire]

20:52.834 --> 20:53.961
[Usagi gasps]

20:54.878 --> 20:56.338
[screaming and gunfire]

20:57.381 --> 20:59.383
- Hide them under the cars.
- Okay.

21:02.344 --> 21:04.346
[gunfire continues]

21:19.027 --> 21:22.281
[Arisu] The only blimps left are the King
of Spades and the Queen of Hearts.

21:22.364 --> 21:25.534
Anybody who's left is gathering in Shibuya
now that they've seen the blimps.

21:25.617 --> 21:28.495
We can't go further until we take down
the King of Spades.

21:30.580 --> 21:32.040
Huh? Look!

21:33.292 --> 21:34.751
[gunfire continues]

21:37.754 --> 21:39.381
Kuina! Ann!

21:40.465 --> 21:42.092
[Kuina gasps] Arisu!

21:42.801 --> 21:44.386
[crowd shouting]

21:48.640 --> 21:49.891
It's been a while.

21:49.975 --> 21:51.685
[Usagi] You're both okay. I'm so glad.

21:51.768 --> 21:53.353
It's good to see you again.

21:53.937 --> 21:55.022
Did Chishiya make it?

21:56.732 --> 21:57.649
Yeah.

22:00.569 --> 22:01.945
I saw him. He's good.

22:02.612 --> 22:03.780
[Kuina] Great.

22:03.864 --> 22:06.199
Looks like the King of Spades
wants to settle things here.

22:06.783 --> 22:08.160
We'll take the King down together.

22:10.662 --> 22:11.705
[Usagi gasps]

22:37.564 --> 22:38.398
[Ann screams]

22:39.232 --> 22:40.108
Ann!

22:40.192 --> 22:41.943
[Ann gasping]

22:43.362 --> 22:44.696
No! No!

22:52.996 --> 22:54.164
[Ann groans]

23:05.717 --> 23:06.718
[engine whirring]

23:30.033 --> 23:32.744
Yeah! We did it!

23:32.828 --> 23:34.162
- We got him!
- Finally!

23:34.246 --> 23:36.206
- We're finally free!
- Finally! Yeah!

23:36.289 --> 23:37.290
[laughter]

23:37.374 --> 23:39.501
- We did it!
- Yeah!

23:39.584 --> 23:41.253
- [gunfire]
- [Usagi gasps]

23:43.588 --> 23:44.923
[crowd gasping]

23:47.509 --> 23:49.177
[ominous music]

23:56.476 --> 23:57.853
- [Usagi gasps]
- [gunfire]

24:17.164 --> 24:18.665
- Arisu!
- [gunfire]

24:39.436 --> 24:40.687
Shit!

25:02.918 --> 25:04.836
- I keep missing. Fuck.
- Let's go!

25:07.839 --> 25:08.882
[groans]

25:16.556 --> 25:17.599
Arisu!

25:17.682 --> 25:19.684
[gunfire continues]

25:24.022 --> 25:25.565
[Kuina] Come on! They're in here!

25:32.531 --> 25:33.865
[Akane] Arisu!

25:34.574 --> 25:35.742
[gunfire stops]

25:37.869 --> 25:39.162
Heya.

25:40.580 --> 25:41.581
Are you Usagi?

25:42.332 --> 25:43.333
Yeah.

25:45.085 --> 25:46.294
Good to meet you.

25:50.257 --> 25:53.176
- [gunfire]
- [Aguni] He'll run out of ammo soon.

25:53.260 --> 25:55.178
Stay in here where there's cover.

25:55.262 --> 25:56.680
Aguni?

25:57.180 --> 25:59.849
Aguni. What are you doing here?

26:02.269 --> 26:03.728
I followed you here.

26:05.105 --> 26:06.648
So you do love me.

26:07.649 --> 26:08.942
[gunfire continues]

26:11.027 --> 26:13.863
[Aguni] He's just human.
He's not invincible.

26:14.531 --> 26:16.324
And as for his guns,

26:16.408 --> 26:18.118
he won't be able to shoot forever.

26:18.618 --> 26:21.955
Once he runs out of ammo,
he'll need to restock.

26:22.038 --> 26:24.165
I think they drop supplies
from the blimps.

26:26.960 --> 26:28.253
We've all got weapons.

26:37.429 --> 26:40.098
But this is all the ammo I've got left.

26:42.434 --> 26:44.269
- [wails]
- [yells]

26:49.649 --> 26:51.067
[men yelling]

26:55.238 --> 26:57.490
[gasps] I almost forgot.

26:58.658 --> 27:00.452
My good luck charm.

27:00.535 --> 27:02.329
This is the bomb Chishiya made.

27:03.371 --> 27:04.414
Chishiya?

27:05.206 --> 27:06.666
A lot of good that toy will do us.

27:06.750 --> 27:10.003
We can lure him in
and use it at close range. [sniffs]

27:11.129 --> 27:14.966
From the way it smells,
I'm guessing the bomb contains kerosene.

27:15.050 --> 27:16.551
An ANFO bomb.

27:16.635 --> 27:18.928
Then the explosion it makes
won't be that big.

27:20.597 --> 27:22.390
I can see a drugstore over there.

27:22.474 --> 27:24.517
If we can fill it up with gas,

27:25.101 --> 27:26.811
then the explosion will be bigger.

27:27.479 --> 27:28.438
Are you sure?

27:30.148 --> 27:31.066
Probably.

27:31.650 --> 27:34.778
So you're saying, someone needs
to lure the King of Spades in there?

27:35.362 --> 27:36.279
Yeah.

27:37.072 --> 27:40.075
I'll wait for him inside the store,
and then trigger it.

27:40.158 --> 27:42.243
You're going to die if you do that.

27:42.327 --> 27:44.579
No. I'll make it out.

27:44.663 --> 27:45.705
[Ann] How?

27:46.748 --> 27:48.500
When the bomb detonates,

27:48.583 --> 27:50.543
if I'm on the second floor,

27:50.627 --> 27:52.545
I'll be able to survive the fall.

27:53.922 --> 27:55.006
Probably.

27:57.258 --> 27:59.552
You know, you say "probably" a lot.

28:00.679 --> 28:02.639
His "probably" is worth betting on.

28:02.722 --> 28:04.224
It's worth its weight in gold.

28:05.433 --> 28:06.518
I'll be the bait.

28:07.519 --> 28:08.645
I'll lure him in.

28:09.979 --> 28:12.023
It's reckless to try to do it alone.

28:12.857 --> 28:14.651
I've handled a lot worse.

28:16.653 --> 28:18.905
We'll… we'll do it together.

28:18.988 --> 28:22.117
Yes, together. Just leave it to us.

28:30.333 --> 28:31.543
[scoffs]

28:33.128 --> 28:35.380
All right, then. Let's do it.

28:53.314 --> 28:54.232
[yells]

29:00.071 --> 29:03.867
[Aguni] We'll lure him to an alley
so he can't get more ammo from the blimp.

29:04.409 --> 29:06.828
Then we'll lure him
to the drugstore from there.

29:07.829 --> 29:09.330
I'm gonna go first.

29:09.414 --> 29:12.125
While I'm doing that,
you'll go to the alley and draw him in.

29:12.208 --> 29:14.252
- Okay.
- Arisu.

29:15.211 --> 29:17.213
Make sure that store is filled with gas.

29:18.006 --> 29:18.923
Yeah.

29:26.431 --> 29:27.432
[groans]

29:59.672 --> 30:01.508
[panting]

30:21.444 --> 30:22.612
[yelps]

30:23.780 --> 30:24.948
[panting]

30:26.282 --> 30:28.076
This thing's a piece of shit!

30:29.202 --> 30:30.119
Oh!

30:46.135 --> 30:47.554
Ann, you almost hit me!

30:49.472 --> 30:50.890
I'm making sure I don't hit you!

31:23.631 --> 31:25.425
[footsteps]

31:35.727 --> 31:37.729
[breathing unsteadily]

31:46.696 --> 31:48.114
[exhales]

31:50.783 --> 31:52.160
[hissing]

31:52.243 --> 31:53.661
[Arisu coughing]

32:17.936 --> 32:19.145
[Kuina screams]

33:05.525 --> 33:06.859
[yells]

33:12.615 --> 33:13.783
[screams]

33:36.639 --> 33:37.640
[gasps]

33:45.398 --> 33:46.441
[gasps]

33:46.524 --> 33:47.734
Ann!

33:49.318 --> 33:50.445
[groans]

33:52.113 --> 33:53.156
[whimpers softly]

33:55.700 --> 33:56.868
[sobs]

34:02.707 --> 34:04.333
[roars]

34:40.995 --> 34:41.913
[roars]

34:57.261 --> 34:58.805
[Aguni groans]

35:15.279 --> 35:16.614
[Kuina screams]

35:42.807 --> 35:44.392
[screaming]

35:46.435 --> 35:47.770
[groans]

35:47.854 --> 35:49.397
[Usagi screaming]

36:02.368 --> 36:04.370
[screeches]

36:05.705 --> 36:07.123
[Aguni groans]

36:20.511 --> 36:21.929
[screams]

36:30.146 --> 36:31.314
[King yells]

36:43.743 --> 36:44.952
[Aguni groans]

37:03.888 --> 37:05.890
[coughing]

37:14.941 --> 37:16.943
[grunting softly]

37:26.077 --> 37:27.453
[wheezing]

37:38.047 --> 37:39.548
[Usagi whimpering]

37:57.400 --> 37:58.693
[Usagi whimpering]

38:07.076 --> 38:08.119
[hisses]

38:10.997 --> 38:12.373
Come out.

38:16.002 --> 38:17.169
Come here.

38:25.678 --> 38:27.138
[coughing]

38:47.158 --> 38:48.909
[coughs]

39:14.393 --> 39:15.686
Come on.

39:16.687 --> 39:17.855
Come on.

39:17.938 --> 39:19.940
[coughing]

40:02.858 --> 40:04.610
- Arisu! Do it!
- [King roaring]

40:07.113 --> 40:08.280
Aguni!

40:08.864 --> 40:10.116
- [King yelling]
- Are you crazy?

40:12.660 --> 40:13.702
[gasps]

40:13.786 --> 40:14.787
Throw it!

41:03.711 --> 41:05.713
[grunting]

41:29.320 --> 41:31.322
[breathing heavily]

41:41.916 --> 41:44.668
[both grunt]

42:05.606 --> 42:06.607
Aguni!

42:06.690 --> 42:07.775
[grunts]

42:07.858 --> 42:09.610
Go. [panting]

42:14.615 --> 42:16.992
- Where are they?
- They're all okay.

42:18.953 --> 42:21.288
You've gotta go on to the last game.

42:30.923 --> 42:32.091
[coughs]

42:36.303 --> 42:37.555
[gasping]

42:43.894 --> 42:45.145
- Usagi!
- [gasps]

42:49.149 --> 42:50.317
Usagi!

42:52.361 --> 42:53.195
Usagi!

42:55.114 --> 42:56.073
Usagi!

43:08.002 --> 43:09.253
[grunting]

43:24.810 --> 43:26.520
[breathing shallowly]

43:35.404 --> 43:37.406
[groaning softly]

44:15.569 --> 44:17.571
[emotional ambient music]

44:22.534 --> 44:24.495
[gunfire and explosions]

45:06.203 --> 45:07.121
[gasps]

45:08.330 --> 45:10.499
I'm-- I'm sorry.

45:10.582 --> 45:12.126
[gasps]

45:22.136 --> 45:24.179
That was the only way…

45:29.893 --> 45:33.522
that I knew how to save you.

45:47.161 --> 45:48.662
[shot echoes]

45:52.124 --> 45:53.500
Sorry.

46:08.098 --> 46:09.475
I want you to know…

46:12.269 --> 46:14.021
I never held it against you.

46:16.231 --> 46:17.941
[laughing]

46:32.080 --> 46:33.791
[shot echoes]

46:46.136 --> 46:47.888
What am I supposed to do now?

47:17.709 --> 47:18.710
[Takeru] Mori.

47:31.974 --> 47:33.392
What are you doing here?

47:35.018 --> 47:36.562
Should I beg your forgiveness?

47:39.231 --> 47:40.065
Nah.

47:42.067 --> 47:43.610
I'm the one who should

47:45.237 --> 47:46.655
beg you to forgive me.

47:51.743 --> 47:53.453
I forced my best friend

47:54.705 --> 47:56.832
into a role he didn't want to play.

48:12.264 --> 48:13.557
Take care, my friend.

48:27.946 --> 48:28.989
[chuckles]

48:34.328 --> 48:36.330
[emotional music]

49:09.029 --> 49:10.405
[grunts]

49:34.054 --> 49:35.639
[whimpering]

49:51.363 --> 49:53.031
[sobbing] Aguni.

50:01.957 --> 50:03.417
[ragged breathing]

50:04.918 --> 50:06.086
[Kuina] Shit.

50:07.921 --> 50:10.048
I can't get up.

50:10.799 --> 50:12.092
[sighs]

50:13.176 --> 50:14.803
- [Ann] There's…
- [gasping]

50:16.763 --> 50:18.015
[sighs]

50:18.765 --> 50:20.392
…only one left.

50:20.475 --> 50:22.227
[Kuina gasps] Huh…

50:22.310 --> 50:24.563
Huh? [gasps]

50:27.399 --> 50:28.650
Ann, you're

50:29.776 --> 50:30.986
still alive.

50:33.905 --> 50:35.032
[sighs]

50:36.366 --> 50:37.409
Promise…

50:38.035 --> 50:38.994
[gasps]

50:40.787 --> 50:42.247
…if we meet again…

50:46.084 --> 50:47.169
[gasps]

50:48.253 --> 50:49.671
…we'll be friends.

50:51.173 --> 50:53.175
[breathing shakily]

50:58.055 --> 50:59.431
[sighs]

51:02.976 --> 51:04.978
[emotional music swells]

51:08.732 --> 51:09.733
Ann.

51:12.152 --> 51:13.195
Ann?

51:16.656 --> 51:18.116
[whimpers]

51:27.084 --> 51:28.376
[Arisu] Usagi!

51:33.298 --> 51:34.382
Usagi?

51:49.022 --> 51:51.566
- [computer] This is the final game.
- [music fades]

51:51.650 --> 51:55.695
Participating players
should register immediately.

52:01.827 --> 52:03.620
[Usagi gasping]

52:06.498 --> 52:08.500
[dramatic music]

52:39.030 --> 52:41.032
[engine rumbling]

53:13.523 --> 53:14.900
If the rules

53:15.650 --> 53:18.528
force the players
to start killing each other…

53:20.363 --> 53:21.656
I promise that

53:22.574 --> 53:23.909
I'm going to protect you.

53:25.660 --> 53:26.745
That

53:27.621 --> 53:28.914
makes you sound…

53:29.956 --> 53:30.999
[gasping]

53:32.167 --> 53:34.252
…ridiculous right now.

53:35.545 --> 53:37.255
[both chuckle]

53:39.758 --> 53:41.176
[wind whistling]

53:42.010 --> 53:44.012
[dramatic music]

55:06.761 --> 55:07.971
Welcome

55:08.722 --> 55:10.890
to your final game venue!

55:16.730 --> 55:19.024
[theme music]
